    "enUS": {
      "description": "<The large hunk of crystal is even heavier than it looks. While it appears to be quite the prize, its true nature is unknown to you. Someone with an eye for valuables could say what you've really found.>",
      "summary": "Find someone to appraise the Humongous Crystal.",
      "title": "Pay Dirt!",
